  "description": "Exceptional A1-Rated 4-Bedroom  | Ashtown | 180 sqm\nPresenting this bright and exceptionally spacious four-bedroom  in the highly sought-after Ashtown area. Extending to approximately 180 sqm, this impressive three-storey property offers generous, well-proportioned accommodation combined with outstanding energy efficiency.\n\nThe home boasts an A1 BER rating and features solar panels with battery storage, significantly reducing energy consumption and household bills. Heating is provided by an air-to-water heat pump, with individual thermostats on each level, ensuring efficient and comfortable heating throughout the home.\n\nThe property also benefits from a west-facing rear garden, perfect for enjoying afternoon and evening sunshine, along with two dedicated parking spaces on the private driveway.\n\nAn additional lifestyle benefit is complimentary gym membership at two nearby fitness centres, providing convenient access to local fitness facilities adding further lifestyle value to this already well-equipped .\n\nGround Floor\nThe welcoming ground floor comprises:\n* Entrance hallway\n* Bright and spacious living room\n* Guest WC\n* Modern fully fitted kitchen\n* Generous kitchen/dining area\n* Separate utility room\n* Second TV/family room\n\nThe kitchen and dining area provides an excellent social and family space, while the additional TV room offers flexibility for relaxing, entertaining or family use.\n\nFirst Floor\nThe first floor provides excellent bedroom accommodation, comprising:\n* Large en-suite bedroom with space for a king-size bed\n* Spacious double bedroom\n* Box room\n* Family bathroom\n* Fitted wardrobes\n\nSecond Floor\nThe impressive second floor is dedicated to the master suite and additional storage:\n* Large master bedroom with striking double-height ceiling\n* En-suite bathroom\n* Walk-in wardrobe area\n* Hot press\n* Attic storage\n\nOutside\nTo the rear, the property enjoys a west-facing garden, providing a wonderful outdoor space with excellent afternoon and evening light. To the front, there are two dedicated parking spaces on the private driveway.\n\nProperty Highlights\n* Approximately 180 sqm\n* A1 BER rating\n* Four-bedroom \n* Three-storey accommodation\n* Solar panels & battery storage\n* Air-to-water heating system\n* Individual thermostats on each level\n* Modern fully fitted kitchen\n* Two living/TV rooms\n* Multiple bathrooms and en-suites\n* Master bedroom with double-height ceiling\n* Walk-in wardrobe area\n* Fitted wardrobes\n* Attic storage\n* West-facing rear garden\n* Two private driveway parking spaces\n* Free gym membership at two nearby fitness centres\n* Highly desirable Ashtown location\n\nA superb opportunity to acquire a substantial, highly energy-efficient  in Ashtown. With approximately 180 sqm of accommodation, excellent bedroom and living space, an A1 BER rating, solar and battery technology, a west-facing garden and complimentary access to two nearby fitness centres, this home offers an exceptional combination of space, comfort, energy efficiency and lifestyle convenience.",
